{
    "id":  900014,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Controller 230V 3-Channel RF 2.4GHz - RGB / CCT / Dimming - for 220-240V LED Strips - 3 x 1A",
    "reference":  "S3",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3-in-1 controller for high-voltage (230V) LED strips\u003c/strong\u003e: controls \u003cstrong\u003eRGB\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003edual-colour (CCT)\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003esingle-colour\u003c/strong\u003e strips, up to about 50 m. Works with \u003cstrong\u003eRF 2.4GHz\u003c/strong\u003e single- or multi-zone remotes (up to 10 per controller) and with a standard \u003cstrong\u003epush switch\u003c/strong\u003e for on/off and dimming.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3 x 1A outputs, smooth 0–100% dimming in 4096 steps, 10 built-in RGB dynamic modes, CE and RoHS.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Controller 230V 3-Channel | RF 2.4GHz + Push Dim\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e3-channel controller for high-voltage LED strips; controls up to about 50 m (depends on the strip).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e3-in-1: RGB, colour temperature (CCT) or single-colour strips.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePairs with RF 2.4GHz single-zone or multi-zone remotes (single colour, dual colour, RGB/RGBW); up to 10 remotes per controller.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e4096-level, flicker-free 0–100% dimming.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e10 built-in dynamic modes for RGB strips (jump, smooth, fade).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSelectable 3 s fade-in / fade-out.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExternal push switch: short press on/off, long press stepless dimming, with dimming memory after power loss.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTechnical data\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eInput voltage\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e100-240VAC, 50/60Hz\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eInput current\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e3.2A\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput voltage\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e3 x (100-240)VDC\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput current\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e3 channels, 1A per channel\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOutput power\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e3 x (100-240)W\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eControl\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRF 2.4GHz + push dim\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDimming\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e0-100%, 4096 levels, PWM 2kHz\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eOperating temperature\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTa -30 ~ +55ºC (Tc max. +85ºC)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSize\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e178 x 50 x 38mm (package); 175 x 45 x 27mm (unit)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e0.136 kg\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eStandards\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eEN IEC 55015, EN IEC 61547, ETSI EN 301 489-1/-3, ETSI EN 300 440, EN 61347-1/-2\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCertification\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eCE, RoHS\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWarranty\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e5 years\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePairing a remote\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eShort press the MATCH key, then immediately press the on/off key (single-zone remote) or zone key (multi-zone remote); the LED indicator flashes quickly when paired. To delete all paired remotes, hold MATCH for 5 s. Without the key: switch the power off and on twice, then press on/off or zone 3 times to pair, or 5 times to delete.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eInstallation notes\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eFor high-voltage LED strips only. Check all wiring and polarity before switching on.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUse at about 80% of full load.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDo not stack units; keep at least 20 cm between them and from metal objects, wall corners and beams; install at least 1 m above the floor for good RF range.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
